{"id": "ru-6785d1199739.ru", "jokeId": "ru-6785d1199739", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Pure dialogue, no narrator; lines kept as written (Latin H typo fixed). Museum gallery: the drunk stands at the exhibit on the back plane, his friend with glasses in front. The museum has no specimen jars, so a jar shelf is requested.", "title": "Три лягушки", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ну просто сердце кровью обливается, как вижу этих заспиртованных животных!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Да что ты, там же всего три лягушки...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вот именно — три лягушки. А спирта — литров десять!!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "needs": [{"kind": "backdrop", "id": "specimen-jars", "description": "a museum shelf or glass case with big jars of frogs preserved in alcohol (zoology museum variant of zal:museum)", "why": "the whole dialogue is about three frogs in ten liters of spirit; the gallery shows only paintings"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "still-life"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "front-left"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "cry"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-6785d1199739.en", "jokeId": "ru-6785d1199739", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; ten liters localised to two and a half gallons. Museum gallery: the drunk at the exhibit on the back plane, his friend with glasses in front. A specimen-jar shelf is requested.", "title": "Three Frogs", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "It just breaks my heart to see these animals preserved in alcohol!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Oh, come on, there are only three frogs in there...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Exactly. Three frogs. And a good two and a half gallons of alcohol!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "needs": [{"kind": "backdrop", "id": "specimen-jars", "description": "a museum shelf or glass case with big jars of frogs preserved in alcohol (zoology museum variant of zal:museum)", "why": "the whole dialogue is about three frogs in gallons of alcohol; the gallery shows only paintings"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "still-life"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "front-left"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "cry"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-6785d1199739.de", "jokeId": "ru-6785d1199739", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation, liters kept. Museum gallery: the drunk at the exhibit on the back plane, his friend with glasses in front. A specimen-jar shelf is requested.", "title": "Drei Frösche", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Mir blutet echt das Herz, wenn ich diese in Alkohol eingelegten Tiere sehe!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Ach komm, da sind doch nur drei Frösche drin...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Eben. Drei Frösche. Und Alkohol — gut zehn Liter!!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "needs": [{"kind": "backdrop", "id": "specimen-jars", "description": "a museum shelf or glass case with big jars of frogs preserved in alcohol (zoology museum variant of zal:museum)", "why": "the whole dialogue is about three frogs in ten liters of alcohol; the gallery shows only paintings"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["muzhik-ryzhy", "muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "still-life"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "front-left"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "cry"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.ru", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "All three calls kept in full; each call split where the topic changes. Numbers written as words; 'НР' expanded to 'новый русский' for TTS; '300 000 тысяч' read as the obvious typo for 'триста тысяч'. Three New Russians sit on the three bench marks, bare-chested (clothes = skin) with gold chains and towels; the speaker picks up the phone, the friends drink.", "title": "В бане", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Сидят несколько новых русских в бане.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Звонит сотовик.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Один из них берёт трубку:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Платье?? Тысяча долларов? Зачем тебе пятидесятое платье?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "В театр сходить? Ну ладно. Деньги знаешь где? Купи.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Опять звонок, тот же новый русский берёт трубку:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Шубу?? Зачем тебе десятая шуба??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "На Канары съездить? Пятьдесят тысяч?? Ну ладно... Деньги знаешь где...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Опять звонок, опять тот же новый русский:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Машину??? Зачем тебе шестая машина???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Перед мамой выпендриться? Сколько??? Триста тысяч гринов??? Ну ладно... Покупай... Деньги знаешь где...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Отключает трубку...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Гм... кхем... мужики, чей телефон?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["towel"], "remove": ["suit"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#efc8a0"}, "muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "put"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "think"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.en", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Per adaptNote the New Russians became generic rich guys; the sauna is kept (we have the backdrop). All three calls translated in full and split where the topic changes; greenbacks kept as dollars/bucks. Three rich guys sit on the bench marks, bare-chested with gold chains and towels.", "title": "At the Sauna", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A few rich guys are sitting in a sauna.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "A cell phone rings.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "One of them picks it up:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A dress?? A thousand dollars? What do you need a fiftieth dress for?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "To go to the theatre? Well, all right. You know where the money is? Buy it.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Another call, the same rich guy picks it up:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A fur coat?? What do you need a tenth fur coat for??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "A trip to the Canaries? Fifty thousand?? Well, all right... you know where the money is...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Another call, the same rich guy again:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A car??? What do you need a sixth car for???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "To show off in front of your mom? How much??? Three hundred thousand bucks??? Well, all right... buy it... you know where the money is...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He hangs up...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hmm... ahem... guys, whose phone is this?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["towel"], "remove": ["suit"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#efc8a0"}, "muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "put"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "think"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.de", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Per adaptNote the New Russians became generic rich guys; sauna kept. All three calls translated in full and split where the topic changes; dollars localised to euros. Three rich guys sit on the bench marks, bare-chested with gold chains and towels.", "title": "In der Sauna", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein paar reiche Typen sitzen in der Sauna.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Handy klingelt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Einer von ihnen geht ran:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Ein Kleid?? Tausend Euro? Wozu brauchst du ein fünfzigstes Kleid?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Ins Theater gehen? Na gut. Du weißt, wo das Geld ist? Kauf es.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Wieder ein Anruf, derselbe reiche Typ geht ran:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Einen Pelzmantel?? Wozu brauchst du einen zehnten Pelzmantel??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Auf die Kanaren fliegen? Fünfzigtausend?? Na gut... du weißt, wo das Geld ist...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Wieder ein Anruf, wieder derselbe reiche Typ:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Ein Auto??? Wozu brauchst du ein sechstes Auto???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Vor deiner Mutter angeben? Wie viel??? Dreihunderttausend Euro??? Na gut... kauf's... du weißt, wo das Geld ist...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er legt auf...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hm... ähem... Jungs, wessen Handy ist das?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["towel"], "remove": ["suit"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#efc8a0"}, "muzhik-sosed": {"add": ["gold-chain", "towel"], "clothes": "#e6b48c"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l