{"id": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Wording kept, number written as words; the judge's line split at the question. Courtroom: the judge in a black robe at the bench, the scruffy defendant sits in the dock and stands up to answer.", "title": "Штраф", "location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "lines": [{"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Я приговариваю вас к пятистам рублям денежного штрафа за оскорбление государственного служащего.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Хотели бы вы что-нибудь сказать на это, обвиняемый?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вообще-то хотел бы! Но при таких ценах...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "dock"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e.en", "jokeId": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 500 rubles became five hundred dollars per adaptNote. Courtroom: judge in a black robe at the bench, defendant in the dock stands up to answer.", "title": "The Fine", "location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "lines": [{"character": "nachalnik", "text": "I sentence you to a fine of five hundred dollars for insulting a public official.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Would you like to say anything to that, defendant?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Actually, I would! But at these prices...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "dock"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
